Doctors:
  Left Join DoctorLabs On Id = DoctorLabs.DoctorId
    FirstName + < > + LastName Physician,
    Department.Name Department,
    Location.City ClinicCity,
    Examinations.CountIf(Status = <Completed>) VisitCount,
    Examinations.CountDistinctIf(UserId, Status = <Completed>) PatientCount,
    Examinations.AvgIf(DurationMinutes, Status = <Completed>) AverageVisitMinutes,
    Examinations.SumIf(Charge, Status = <Completed>) Charges,
    (<100> * DoctorLabs.AbnormalCount
/ NullIf(DoctorLabs.LabCount, <0>)).Round(<2>) AbnormalLabPercent
  Where Department.Name IN <Primary Care> + <Specialty Care> + <Emergency Medicine>
  Order VisitCount DESC, Charges DESC
  Take 10
DoctorLabs is LabResults: Visit.DoctorId DoctorId, Count(Id) LabCount, CountIf(IsAbnormal = <true>) AbnormalCount
  Where Visit.Status = <Completed>